Dear Platform Auditor:
Hello! The buyer has provided feedback that the material of the product does not match the description. We have conducted a thorough internal review and investigation, and the situation is as follows:
Due to subtle texture differences in batch styles, there may be a subjective deviation from the page standard description. We deeply apologize for this and acknowledge that our quality control measures were not in place;
We have always been proactive in taking responsibility and have not shifted blame to after-sales service. We have communicated with the buyer in a friendly manner as soon as possible;
To maximize the protection of buyer rights and reduce disputes between both parties, we are willing to offer a high compensation of 60% of the order amount. The goods do not need to be returned by the buyer, and we provide the buyer with the best worry free solution;
We have promised to rectify the procurement and warehouse quality inspection process in the future, optimize the truthful description of product details, and avoid similar customer complaints in the future.
We are willing to assume corresponding responsibilities and provide a high compensation plan. We sincerely request the platform to assist in coordinating with buyers to accept compensation, withdraw disputes, and close the order through negotiation. Thank you for the platform's understanding and review.

